--   - Prova: CARGO_3_ESCRIVO_DE_POLCIA_FEDERAL.pdf (fileId
--     1jk3SHBttofZ1qrTfEykhb0YXlYx-AG3w) - full 120-item CEBRASPE
--     Certo/Errado objective test, cover states "CARGO 3_ESCRIVÃO DE
--     POLÍCIA FEDERAL".
--   - Gabarito: GAB_DEFINITIVO_MATRIZ_577_PF_003_00.pdf (fileId
--     1NPqhTeEj6HOw3867iU4kezMup5r19iOc) - explicitly labeled
--     "CARGO: ESCRIVÃO DE POLÍCIA FEDERAL", Matriz_577_PF_003_00. This
--     matriz's own header text was read fresh in this session and
--     confirmed to literally read "CARGO: ESCRIVÃO DE POLÍ CIA FEDERAL /
--     Matriz_577_PF_003_00" before being trusted as the answer key. Its
--     C/E/X sequence for items 101-120 (X E X E C E C C E E E C X C C E C
--     E C E) is distinct from both Matriz 001 (Delegado) and Matriz 002
--     (Agente) for the same item range, confirming it is cargo-specific
--     and not a mislabeled duplicate.
--   - The file PF_ESCRIVO_617.pdf (fileId 1qCaziB-XsGvuxnC0CqxKh-Rxy1krOWw_)
--     was checked and found to be an unrelated reading-comprehension
